	// `awx_templates` (titles only), `bindings` (`network`, `groups`,
	// `template`, `post_config` only) and `components` with the same
	// and their `key`, `title`, `count` and `anti_affinity`; a
	// composite's `kind`, `rollback_on_failure` and `steps` (`key`,
